    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/peh/terms/DataRole#main_stakeholder> <https://w3id.org/peh/terms/DataRole#supplying_data_controller> <https://w3id.org/peh/terms/DataRole#receiving_data_controller> <https://w3id.org/peh/terms/DataRole#external_data_controller> ) ;
